{
  "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
  "juan": "Preface",
  "section": "總序",
  "entries": [
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P000_S000",
      "original_quote": "總序",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P001_S000",
      "original_quote": "竊惟黃帝戰蚩尤於涿鹿，夢天神授符，而命風後演就奇門，此遁甲所由始也。",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P001_S001",
      "original_quote": "帝堯命大禹治水，得玄女傳文，而因洛龜畫敍九疇，此遁甲所由著也。",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P001_S002",
      "original_quote": "漢子房總局十八 而成決勝之功，蜀孔明分列三奇而創艱難之業。",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P001_S003",
      "original_quote": "先排九宮於掌上，而坎居一、坤居二、震居三、巽居四、中央五、乾六、兌七、艮八、離九，而造化見矣。",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P001_S004",
      "original_quote": "次分八卦 於盤中，而離位於南，坎位於北，震東，兌西，巽東南，坤西南，艮東北，乾西北，而方隅定矣。",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P002_S000",
      "original_quote": "縱橫十五，錯敍三元，以八卦分八節，而節令以全。",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P002_S001",
      "original_quote": "以一節統三氣，而氣候以備。",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P002_S002",
      "original_quote": "逢甲己為符頭，須閏奇而補局，符速節遲，看甲己臨於何處？",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P002_S003",
      "original_quote": "而用超神之法。",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P002_S004",
      "original_quote": "節先 符後，驗日辰甲己何居？",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P002_S005",
      "original_quote": "而行節氣之方。",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P002_S006",
      "original_quote": "子午東部為冬至後陽遁，歷坎、艮、震、巽，儀順行而奇逆布，由直符而順飛於九宮也。",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P002_S007",
      "original_quote": "子午西部為夏至後陰遁，歷離、 坤、兌、乾，奇順布而儀逆行，由直符而逆飛於八卦也。",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P003_S000",
      "original_quote": "認九宮安九星為直符，而吉凶以分。",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P003_S001",
      "original_quote": "如坎宮認天蓬為符，則天芮二、天衝三、天輔四、天禽五、天心六、天柱七、天任八、天英九也。",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P003_S002",
      "original_quote": "配八卦立八門為直使，而休咎 以判。",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P003_S003",
      "original_quote": "如乾宮配開為使，則休門坎、生門艮、傷門震、杜門巽、景門離、死門坤、驚門兌也。",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P003_S004",
      "original_quote": "移直符於時幹，而時幹住處，直符之起首寓矣。",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P003_S005",
      "original_quote": "尋直使於時支，而時支 住處，直使之方向存矣。",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P004_S000",
      "original_quote": "天盤九星共奇儀，而一時一易，象天之旋轉。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P004_S001",
      "original_quote": "地盤九星與奇儀，而五日方移，法地道之貞靜也。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P004_S002",
      "original_quote": "天盤臨地，審吉凶之消長，地盤承天，斷休咎之盈虛。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P004_S003",
      "original_quote": "天甲子臨地甲 子是為伏吟，凡門符臨本宮皆同此例，而不可用也。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P004_S004",
      "original_quote": "地天英逢天天蓬是為反吟，凡門加衝宮皆同此例，而避之可也。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P004_S005",
      "original_quote": "吉門臨三奇而所求皆遂，奇門入墓、迫而所為無 成。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P004_S006",
      "original_quote": "乙、丙、丁、生、休、開如合太陰之位，是謂三全奇吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P004_S007",
      "original_quote": "陰或有無必審從背之方，是謂三奇六儀擊刑至惡，而不可使用。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P005_S000",
      "original_quote": "九遁合門，至利而大可施為。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P005_S001",
      "original_quote": "開門合乙而加己位，不犯奇墓、門迫，名曰「地遁」，臨紫微而蔽，以日精者也。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P005_S002",
      "original_quote": "月奇臨丁而逢生門，不犯奇墓、門迫，號曰「天 遁」，乘華蓋而蔽，以月精者也。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P005_S003",
      "original_quote": "休門與丁奇相合太陰，共地盤相臨，斯為「人遁」，亦可行師。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P005_S004",
      "original_quote": "丙奇同生門而合於九天，遁屬於「神」。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P005_S005",
      "original_quote": "星奇遇休門而臨於九地， 遁屬於「鬼」。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P005_S006",
      "original_quote": "「龍」得月奇合休癸而或臨於坎，「虎」得乙奇臨生門而或出於艮，「風遁」則日開臨於巽，「云遁」則月開合於坤，此九遁之例名，實兵家之秘， 顧用之何如，而驗之無不應也。",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P006_S000",
      "original_quote": "夫星有陰陽，門有開闔。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P006_S001",
      "original_quote": "惟天禽則無定位，寄西南而屬中宮。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P006_S002",
      "original_quote": "從三避五，為害為生。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P006_S003",
      "original_quote": "勝地有三，天上直符所臨天乙，大將居之，一也。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P006_S004",
      "original_quote": "直符後一為九天，我軍居之， 二也。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P006_S005",
      "original_quote": "地生門而合三奇之宮，若引軍而從生門擊死，百戰百勝，三也。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P006_S006",
      "original_quote": "不擊有五，天乙、九天擊之必被其殃，一與二也。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P006_S007",
      "original_quote": "生門、九地犯之必罹其害，三與四也。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P006_S008",
      "original_quote": "直符 而臨直使之位，如用兵突圍、摧陣，將死軍亡，五也。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P006_S009",
      "original_quote": "孟甲刑門，難以出入，而宜隱跡；",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P006_S010",
      "original_quote": "仲甲陽內，宜於堅守，而利於藏兵；",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P006_S011",
      "original_quote": "四季甲時陰內陽外，須分主客，始決雌 雄。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P007_S000",
      "original_quote": "六乙為天德，出從而上，日奇之下，可決勝於未然之內。",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P007_S001",
      "original_quote": "丙為天威，不得丙火銷金之令，宜防敗於不測。",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P007_S002",
      "original_quote": "時臨六丁，名為玉女潛形，如隱伏而不見其象。",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P007_S003",
      "original_quote": "時臨六戊號 曰乘龍萬里，逢凶徒而自滅其蹤。",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P007_S004",
      "original_quote": "六己為地戶，宜陰私而用偷劫。",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P007_S005",
      "original_quote": "六癸為天網，審高下而利逃亡。",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P007_S006",
      "original_quote": "六庚而出戰，咎將及於其師。",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P007_S007",
      "original_quote": "六辛而行師，禍必及於其身。",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P007_S008",
      "original_quote": "六壬為 天牢，而飛禍速至。",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P007_S009",
      "original_quote": "六甲為時首，而應局斯靈。",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P008_S000",
      "original_quote": "甲加丙為「青龍反首」，而動作無阻。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P008_S001",
      "original_quote": "丙加甲為「飛鳥跌穴」，而運用有成。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P008_S002",
      "original_quote": "乙加辛是「青龍逃走」，而財物廢墜。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P008_S003",
      "original_quote": "辛加乙是「白虎猖狂」，而身體毀傷。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P008_S004",
      "original_quote": "丁加癸為 「朱雀投江」，而訟獄所由起也。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P008_S005",
      "original_quote": "癸加丁為「螣蛇夭矯」，而憂惶之事必至也。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P008_S006",
      "original_quote": "六庚加符為「伏宮格」，不利其主，而利其客。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P008_S007",
      "original_quote": "直符加庚為「飛宮格」，不貴於戰， 而貴於謀。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P008_S008",
      "original_quote": "庚加直符，太白格於天乙，外兵侵而主將必敗。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P008_S009",
      "original_quote": "符加六庚，太乙格於太白，強出兵而客將必阻。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P008_S010",
      "original_quote": "直使臨庚名為「野戰」，兵雖精而主困也。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P008_S011",
      "original_quote": "庚加直使名曰 「同宮」，將雖驍而必挫也。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P008_S012",
      "original_quote": "庚加於丙是為「太白入熒惑」，而賊必來。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P008_S013",
      "original_quote": "丙加於庚是為「丙火入金鄉」，而賊必退也，此主客皆不利，莫倚奇門而強用也。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P009_S000",
      "original_quote": "天地「大格」，庚下加癸，天地「小格」，壬上加庚。",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P009_S001",
      "original_quote": "庚加於己，士卒死於中途刑格。",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P009_S002",
      "original_quote": "己加於庚，將兵厄於危路。",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P009_S003",
      "original_quote": "「歲格」，則歲逢於庚；",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P009_S004",
      "original_quote": "「月格」，則庚加朔 建。",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P009_S005",
      "original_quote": "庚臨日乾為「伏乾格」，而主人見傷。",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P009_S006",
      "original_quote": "日乾臨庚為「飛宮格」，而客將不勝。",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P009_S007",
      "original_quote": "時幹剋日幹為「五不遇」，而定損其明。",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P009_S008",
      "original_quote": "丙加日幹名曰「悖亂」，而顛倒紀 綱。",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P010_S000",
      "original_quote": "天有「三門」，天衝、小吉、從魁。",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P010_S001",
      "original_quote": "地有「四戶」，月建除、危、開、定。",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P010_S002",
      "original_quote": "直使相交，乃天乙之所在；",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P010_S003",
      "original_quote": "直符臨處，為天乙之行宮，其直符同乎。",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P010_S004",
      "original_quote": "天乙有難，宜棄門從 坤，後一為九天，二為九地，九天之上利以揚兵，九地之下利以埋伏。",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P010_S005",
      "original_quote": "前三為六合，二為太陰，六合之中逃亡是利，太陰之處潛伏斯宜。",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P010_S006",
      "original_quote": "「三詐」之方舉動皆利，是 休、生、開合乙、丙、丁、九地、太陰、六合而然也。",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P011_S000",
      "original_quote": "「五假」之地各有吉凶，是杜、死、驚、傷、景合九地、太陰、六合，乙、丙、丁、己、癸而致也。",
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Preface_P011_S001",
      "original_quote": "如六戊不測之術，六甲陰符之妙，此乃心悟，難以言傳，有志於衛國安民，出將入相者，不可不知也。",
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
